      "derivation": "W1, W2 and W3 are three withdrawals from exp-frames experiment 06's keyed privacy pool, the sender of all three, each on its own nullifier as its nonce key, so hegota-testnet's disjoint-keys admits them together (FP-12); their roots are at slots 323047, 323047 and 323020, all within the window at the head's current slot 323057. The pool's balance and the keys at 0 are the case's, as a replay reads no state. IL-2 at the next base fee, 7 by FEE-1 since the head used no gas: each has effective tip min(1, 100 - 7) = 1, so they are taken by arrival; each is a Profile 2 candidate with a budget of 410000. IL-2 budgets an includer's own list under either fill: one list cannot know what others list. Under ethrex the whole payload has the budget one list has, so sixteen such lists still protect two withdrawals, not thirty-two."
